Z||000015||Pontiaddict||08-14-2001||01:03 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by hyhy4u:<BR><B>Three things...<P>First off..if it does use use the same chassis couldnt we put the body the Fiero??</B><BR>It's not the same chassis. <P><B>Secondly..could we put that engine in our cars..i mean that things a rocket!!</B><BR>If you want the motor, pull a 2.0L from a Saturn and put it in your car.<P><B>Thirdly..could anything for that car..interior..be put on the Fiero??<P>How much alike are these cars really???</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>They aren't alike at all except for the drivetrain layout. I think you might have misread some of the statements posted here so you might want to read through them agan.<P>PS. No flame intended, just trying to give you the right info.||||reg||1
